{"seq":3,"slug":"direct-mail-risk-compliance","title":"拆包、化整为零与直邮违规防控","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/direct-mail-postal-import-customs/direct-mail-ops/direct-mail-risk-compliance","wordCount":2702,"readingTime":11,"html":"<h1 id=\"拆包-化整为零与直邮违规防控\">拆包、化整为零与直邮违规防控</h1><p>跨境直邮最典型的违规形态不是走私禁限品，而是<strong>合法商品的非法申报方式</strong>：把一个 8000 元的订单拆成两个 4000 元的包裹分别申报，让每一票都落在限值以内；或者把商业批量货物申报成个人自用物品，借用行邮税的免征额。这类操作在业务侧常被包装成「合理避税」，在法律上是伪报，海关一旦查实会追征税款、处以罚款，严重的移交缉私。</p>\n<p>防控这类行为不是加一个校验那么简单——它要求系统能从<strong>行为模式</strong>而非单票属性上识别异常，同时不能误伤正常的个人寄递。本篇讲拆包识别的工程实现、化整为零的判定边界、以及合规防控如何在不过度拦截的前提下落地。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-违规的三种基本形态\">核心概念：违规的三种基本形态</h2><p>先定义清楚要防什么。直邮场景下的违规申报主要有三类。</p>\n<p><strong>拆包（拆单申报）</strong>：同一笔交易被拆成多个包裹或多个申报单元分别申报，目的是让每一票都不触发限值或都享受免征额。特征是「同一收件人 + 同一时段 + 商品可拼合 + 合计超限」。</p>\n<p><strong>化整为零</strong>：同一批货物被拆成多笔交易（多账号、多订单）以规避单次限值与年度限值。与拆包的区别是它拆的是<strong>交易</strong>而不是<strong>包裹</strong>，可能包裹并不拆分但订单被拆。</p>\n<p><strong>伪报品名与价值</strong>：把高税率商品申报成低税率品类，或低报价值。特征是「申报价格显著低于同类商品的市场价分布」。这类伪报能生效的前提是品类归类的模糊空间——HS 编码的归类本身有解释余地，按 <a href=\"https://www.wcoomd.org/en/topics/nomenclature/overview/what-is-the-harmonized-system.aspx\">WCO 对 HS 的说明</a>，HS 由「5000 多个商品组」构成、每组的官方解释由 WCO 的五卷本《注释》提供，且归类争议由 HS 委员会裁定。系统能做的不是判归类，而是检出「申报归类与历史同类商品的分布显著偏离」。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>形态</th>\n<th>拆分对象</th>\n<th>规避目标</th>\n<th>识别特征</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>拆包</td>\n<td>包裹 / 申报单元</td>\n<td>单次限值、免征额</td>\n<td>同收件人短期内多票、商品可拼合</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>化整为零</td>\n<td>交易（订单 / 账号）</td>\n<td>单次与年度限值</td>\n<td>同身份多账号、地址或支付工具重合</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>伪报品名</td>\n<td>商品属性</td>\n<td>税率差异</td>\n<td>申报税率显著低于品类常态</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>低报价值</td>\n<td>金额</td>\n<td>税额与限值</td>\n<td>申报价远低于同类市场分布</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"为什么单票校验拦不住\">为什么单票校验拦不住</h3><p>单票看，拆开的每一票都是「合法」的：金额在限值内、商品在正面清单内、身份真实。只有把多票放在一起看，异常才显现。这意味着防控必须在<strong>聚合层</strong>做，而不是在单票校验层。</p>\n<p>聚合有两个维度：<strong>人</strong>（收件人 / 订购人身份）与<strong>时间窗口</strong>。同一人在一个较短窗口内的多票申报，其合计金额与商品组合才是判定依据。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[申报流水] --&gt; B[按收件人聚窗]&#10;  B --&gt; C{窗口内票数 &gt; 阈值}&#10;  C --&gt;|否| D[正常放行]&#10;  C --&gt;|是| E{商品是否可拼合}&#10;  E --&gt;|否| D&#10;  E --&gt;|是| F{合计金额是否超限}&#10;  F --&gt;|否| D&#10;  F --&gt;|是| G[标记为疑似拆包]&#10;  G --&gt; H{人工复核}&#10;  H --&gt;|确认为正常| I[放行并记录白名单]&#10;  H --&gt;|确认违规| J[拦截 追征 建合规工单]\">graph TD\n  A[申报流水] --&gt; B[按收件人聚窗]\n  B --&gt; C{窗口内票数 &gt; 阈值}\n  C --&gt;|否| D[正常放行]\n  C --&gt;|是| E{商品是否可拼合}\n  E --&gt;|否| D\n  E --&gt;|是| F{合计金额是否超限}\n  F --&gt;|否| D\n  F --&gt;|是| G[标记为疑似拆包]\n  G --&gt; H{人工复核}\n  H --&gt;|确认为正常| I[放行并记录白名单]\n  H --&gt;|确认违规| J[拦截 追征 建合规工单]</pre><h2 id=\"拆包识别的特征工程\">拆包识别的特征工程</h2><p>识别拆包本质是一个分类问题：给定一组申报记录，判断它们是否来自同一笔应合并的交易。可用的特征分四组。</p>\n<p><strong>主体特征</strong>：收件人姓名、身份证哈希、手机号、收货地址。地址要做归一化后比较，否则「XX路 1 号 3 单元」与「XX路1号3单元」会被当成两个地址。</p>\n<p><strong>时间特征</strong>：申报时间间隔。同一交易拆分出的包裹通常在同一时段申报，间隔以小时或天计，而非按消费者的真实购买节奏分布。</p>\n<p><strong>商品特征</strong>：品类重合度、单件数量、SKU 分布。可拼合的判据是「商品能组成一个合理的消费组合」——例如同一型号的三件不同尺码童装，显然是拆开的三件而非三个独立订单。</p>\n<p><strong>金额特征</strong>：单票金额是否恰好落在限值下方（例如大量订单集中在 4800–4999 元区间），这是最直接的信号。</p>\n<h3 id=\"地址与身份的归一化\">地址与身份的归一化</h3><p>归一化质量直接决定识别效果。常见做法：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 地址归一化：剥离空白与常见冗余词，生成可比对键&#10;CREATE OR REPLACE FUNCTION addr_key(raw text) RETURNS text AS $$&#10;  SELECT regexp_replace(&#10;    regexp_replace(&#10;      lower(coalesce(raw, &#39;&#39;)),&#10;      &#39;[\\s\\-_,，。、]&#39;, &#39;&#39;, &#39;g&#39;&#10;    ),&#10;    &#39;(省|市|区|县|路|街|号|栋|单元|室|小区|大厦)$&#39;, &#39;&#39;, &#39;g&#39;&#10;  );&#10;$$ LANGUAGE sql IMMUTABLE;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 地址归一化：剥离空白与常见冗余词，生成可比对键</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE OR REPLACE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> FUNCTION</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> addr_key</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">raw</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> text</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">RETURNS</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> text</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> $$</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> regexp_replace(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    regexp_replace(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      lower</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">coalesce</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">raw</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">''</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">      '[\\s\\-_,，。、]'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">''</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'g'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    ),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    '(省|市|区|县|路|街|号|栋|单元|室|小区|大厦)$'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">''</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'g'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  );</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">$$ </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">LANGUAGE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> sql</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> IMMUTABLE;</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这个函数只处理最基础的变体。真实场景下还需要处理错别字、同音字、门牌号格式差异——这些通常交给专门的地址标准化服务，本函数只做兜底。注意函数是 <code>IMMUTABLE</code> 的，因此可以建表达式索引。</p>\n<h3 id=\"用窗口聚合产出候选集\">用窗口聚合产出候选集</h3><p>识别的第一步是产出候选集，而不是直接判定。候选集要控制在可人工复核的规模内——若每天产出上千条候选，运营根本处理不完，最终会变成「全部放行」。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 拆包候选集：同身份 7 日内多票 + 商品可拼 + 合计超单次限值&#10;WITH windowed AS (&#10;  SELECT&#10;    d.buyer_id_hash,&#10;    count(*)                        AS decl_cnt,&#10;    sum(d.total_amount_c)           AS sum_amount_c,&#10;    min(d.created_at)               AS first_at,&#10;    max(d.created_at)               AS last_at,&#10;    array_agg(DISTINCT d.category)  AS categories&#10;  FROM declaration_list d&#10;  WHERE d.created_at &gt;= now() - interval &#39;7 days&#39;&#10;    AND d.status IN (&#39;RELEASED&#39;, &#39;ASSESSED&#39;)&#10;  GROUP BY d.buyer_id_hash&#10;)&#10;SELECT&#10;  w.buyer_id_hash,&#10;  w.decl_cnt,&#10;  w.sum_amount_c / 100.0            AS sum_amount_cny,&#10;  w.categories,&#10;  extract(epoch FROM (w.last_at - w.first_at)) / 3600 AS span_hours&#10;FROM windowed w&#10;WHERE w.decl_cnt &gt;= 3&#10;  AND w.sum_amount_c &gt; 500000        -- 合计超 5000 元（单位：分）&#10;  AND array_length(w.categories, 1) &lt;= 3   -- 品类高度集中，可拼合&#10;ORDER BY w.sum_amount_c DESC;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 拆包候选集：同身份 7 日内多票 + 商品可拼 + 合计超单次限值</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WITH</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> windowed </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  SELECT</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    d</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">buyer_id_hash</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    count</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)                        </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> decl_cnt,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    sum</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">d</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">total_amount_c</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)           </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sum_amount_c,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    min</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">d</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">created_at</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)               </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> first_at,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    max</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">d</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">created_at</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)               </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> last_at,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    array_agg(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DISTINCT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> d</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">category</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> categories</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> declaration_list d</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> d</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">created_at</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> >=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> interval </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'7 days'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    AND</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> d</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">status</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> IN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'RELEASED'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'ASSESSED'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  GROUP BY</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> d</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">buyer_id_hash</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  w</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">buyer_id_hash</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  w</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">decl_cnt</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  w</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">sum_amount_c</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> /</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 100</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">            AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sum_amount_cny,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  w</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">categories</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  extract(epoch </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">w</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">last_at</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> -</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> w</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">first_at</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 3600</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> span_hours</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> windowed w</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> w</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">decl_cnt</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> >=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 3</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  AND</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> w</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">sum_amount_c</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 500000</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">        -- 合计超 5000 元（单位：分）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  AND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> array_length(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">w</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">categories</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 3</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">   -- 品类高度集中，可拼合</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> w</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">sum_amount_c</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DESC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><p>三个条件缺一不可：票数阈值过滤偶发多票、金额阈值过滤正常的多次小额购买、品类集中度过滤「同一人买了各种不同东西」这种正常情形。</p>\n<h2 id=\"化整为零的判定边界\">化整为零的判定边界</h2><p>化整为零比拆包更隐蔽，因为它的载体是<strong>账号</strong>。同一个人用多个账号下单，每个账号看起来都是独立消费者。</p>\n<h3 id=\"身份归并是前提\">身份归并是前提</h3><p>判定化整为零的前提是能把多个账号归并到同一个真实身份。归并依据是申报必需的实名身份——既然直购通道要求订购人实名（见 <a href=\"../postal-customs-clear/direct-declare-document\">申报要素</a>），那么同一身份证下的多个账号共享额度，也就能被识别为同一主体。</p>\n<p>归并的边界要小心：<strong>同一身份证不等于同一消费者</strong>。家庭成员可能共用身份信息，企业员工可能代收。系统不能把归并结果直接当作违规证据，只能当作风险评分的一个输入。</p>\n<h3 id=\"与正常行为的区分\">与正常行为的区分</h3><p>区分化整为零与正常行为，关键在于<strong>交易意图的可解释性</strong>。三个判据：</p>\n<p><strong>商品是否重复</strong>：同一个账号买同一商品三次，与三个账号各买一次同一商品，后者更可疑。正常的多账号场景通常是不同人在买不同东西。</p>\n<p><strong>支付工具是否重合</strong>：多个账号共用同一张银行卡或同一支付账户，是强信号。但要注意礼品、代付等正常场景。</p>\n<p><strong>收货地址是否收敛</strong>：多个账号收货地址高度重合但身份信息不同，这是拆单的经典形态。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>判据</th>\n<th>正常情形</th>\n<th>可疑情形</th>\n<th>权重</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>商品重复度</td>\n<td>不同账号买不同商品</td>\n<td>多账号买同一 SKU</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>支付工具重合</td>\n<td>偶尔代付</td>\n<td>多账号共用同一卡</td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>地址收敛</td>\n<td>同一家庭/公司</td>\n<td>身份不同地址相同</td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>额度接近上限</td>\n<td>随机分布</td>\n<td>多账号都恰好接近限额</td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"风险评分而非二值判定\">风险评分而非二值判定</h3><p>把上述判据加权成风险分，按分数分层处置。二值判定会产生大量误判——合规业务里的真实异常分布是连续的，不是二元的。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;entityId&quot;: &quot;buyer_hash_7f3a...&quot;,&#10;  &quot;scoreWindow&quot;: &quot;2026-09-20/2026-09-27&quot;,&#10;  &quot;signals&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;multiAccountSameIdNo&quot;: 3,&#10;    &quot;sharedPaymentInstrument&quot;: 2,&#10;    &quot;addressConvergence&quot;: 2,&#10;    &quot;quotaProximityRatio&quot;: 0.97,&#10;    &quot;skuRepeatAcrossAccounts&quot;: 2&#10;  },&#10;  &quot;riskScore&quot;: 78,&#10;  &quot;band&quot;: &quot;manual_review&quot;,&#10;  &quot;autoAction&quot;: &quot;hold_declaration&quot;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"entityId\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"buyer_hash_7f3a...\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"scoreWindow\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2026-09-20/2026-09-27\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"signals\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"multiAccountSameIdNo\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"sharedPaymentInstrument\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"addressConvergence\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"quotaProximityRatio\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.97</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"skuRepeatAcrossAccounts\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"riskScore\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">78</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"band\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"manual_review\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"autoAction\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"hold_declaration\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>分数落在不同区间对应不同动作：低分放行、中分记录并观察、高分人工复核、极高分拦截。</p>\n<h2 id=\"防控的误伤与申诉\">防控的误伤与申诉</h2><h3 id=\"误伤的代价\">误伤的代价</h3><p>误伤的代价不只是用户体验，还有真实的商业损失——合规消费者被拦截后会流失，且申诉流程的成本通常高于该订单的毛利。因此防控的默认取向应当是「宁可漏判、不可误伤」，只在风险分足够高时才拦截。</p>\n<h3 id=\"申诉通道要能反哺模型\">申诉通道要能反哺模型</h3><p>申诉结果是最有价值的标注数据。每一次「用户申诉成功」都说明当前规则在这类场景下过严，应当据此调整阈值或增加白名单特征。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 申诉结果作为标注：成功率高的特征组合应当降权&#10;SELECT&#10;  a.rule_triggered,&#10;  count(*)                                          AS appeals,&#10;  sum(CASE WHEN a.outcome = &#39;overturned&#39; THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) AS overturned,&#10;  round(&#10;    sum(CASE WHEN a.outcome = &#39;overturned&#39; THEN 1.0 ELSE 0.0 END)&#10;    / count(*), 3&#10;  ) AS overturn_rate&#10;FROM compliance_appeal a&#10;WHERE a.created_at &gt;= now() - interval &#39;90 days&#39;&#10;GROUP BY a.rule_triggered&#10;HAVING count(*) &gt;= 20&#10;ORDER BY overturn_rate DESC;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 申诉结果作为标注：成功率高的特征组合应当降权</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  a</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">rule_triggered</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  count</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)                                          </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> appeals,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  sum</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CASE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> WHEN</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> a</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">outcome</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'overturned'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> THEN</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ELSE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> END</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> overturned,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  round</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    sum</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CASE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> WHEN</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> a</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">outcome</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'overturned'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> THEN</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ELSE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> END</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    /</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> count</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">), </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> overturn_rate</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> compliance_appeal a</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> a</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">created_at</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> >=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> interval </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'90 days'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">GROUP BY</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> a</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">rule_triggered</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">HAVING</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> count</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 20</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> overturn_rate </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DESC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>overturn_rate</code> 高的规则就是误伤源。这个查询应当定期跑，并驱动规则的阈值调整。</p>\n<h3 id=\"白名单要有过期\">白名单要有过期</h3><p>人工复核确认合规后加入白名单是合理的，但白名单必须有过期时间。否则一旦某个身份被加入白名单，后续用它来拆单就永远不会被识别——白名单会变成系统的漏洞。</p>\n<h2 id=\"合规证据的留存\">合规证据的留存</h2><h3 id=\"识别过程本身要留证\">识别过程本身要留证</h3><p>判定为违规的每一票，系统必须留存：触发规则、当时的输入数据、风险分与分项信号、复核人、复核结论。这些在后续与海关沟通或用户争议时是唯一能证明「判定过程合理」的材料。</p>\n<p>证据的保留期通常长于交易数据，应当独立存储（与 <a href=\"../direct-clear-status/inspect-tax-supplement\">抽检/补税/扣货处置</a> 中的凭证留存同理）。</p>\n<h3 id=\"风控数据自身的隐私边界\">风控数据自身的隐私边界</h3><p>风控会大量使用身份、地址、支付信息。这些数据的使用必须有边界：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>数据</th>\n<th>用途限制</th>\n<th>存储要求</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>身份信息</td>\n<td>仅用于主体归并与额度核算</td>\n<td>哈希存储，明文仅申报一跳</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>地址</td>\n<td>仅用于收敛判定</td>\n<td>归一化键可长存，原文按会话留存</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>支付信息</td>\n<td>仅用于重合判定</td>\n<td>仅存支付工具标识，不存卡号</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>行为轨迹</td>\n<td>仅用于风险评分</td>\n<td>聚合后存储，不保留逐条明细超期</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>风控是最容易发生数据越界使用的场景——因为「数据多总比少好」的诱惑在这里最强。边界必须在设计时划定，而不是在数据攒起来之后。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>直邮违规主要是合法商品的非法申报方式：拆包、化整为零、伪报品名、低报价值；单票校验拦不住，必须在聚合层识别。</li>\n<li>拆包识别用四组特征（主体、时间、商品、金额），地址归一化质量决定识别效果；候选集要控制在可人工复核的规模。</li>\n<li>化整为零的载体是账号，身份归并是前提，但同一身份证不等于同一消费者，归并结果只能作为评分输入而非违规证据。</li>\n<li>用风险评分分档处置而非二值判定；防控默认取向是宁可漏判不可误伤，申诉结果要反哺规则调优，白名单必须过期。</li>\n<li>判定过程本身要留证并独立存储；风控数据的用途与存储边界要在设计时划定。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"拆包、化整为零与直邮违规防控","id":"拆包-化整为零与直邮违规防控"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：违规的三种基本形态","id":"核心概念-违规的三种基本形态"},{"level":3,"text":"为什么单票校验拦不住","id":"为什么单票校验拦不住"},{"level":2,"text":"拆包识别的特征工程","id":"拆包识别的特征工程"},{"level":3,"text":"地址与身份的归一化","id":"地址与身份的归一化"},{"level":3,"text":"用窗口聚合产出候选集","id":"用窗口聚合产出候选集"},{"level":2,"text":"化整为零的判定边界","id":"化整为零的判定边界"},{"level":3,"text":"身份归并是前提","id":"身份归并是前提"},{"level":3,"text":"与正常行为的区分","id":"与正常行为的区分"},{"level":3,"text":"风险评分而非二值判定","id":"风险评分而非二值判定"},{"level":2,"text":"防控的误伤与申诉","id":"防控的误伤与申诉"},{"level":3,"text":"误伤的代价","id":"误伤的代价"},{"level":3,"text":"申诉通道要能反哺模型","id":"申诉通道要能反哺模型"},{"level":3,"text":"白名单要有过期","id":"白名单要有过期"},{"level":2,"text":"合规证据的留存","id":"合规证据的留存"},{"level":3,"text":"识别过程本身要留证","id":"识别过程本身要留证"},{"level":3,"text":"风控数据自身的隐私边界","id":"风控数据自身的隐私边界"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"通道税费与时效的综合比价模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/direct-mail-postal-import-customs/direct-mail-ops/channel-tax-cost-compare"},"next":null}